Title: Last Call
Credit: Written by
Author: Gridlight
Draft date: 2026-08-15
Notes: End-to-end test fixture — roughly 30 seconds of screen time, one location, one speaking character, three shots. Deliberately small: it exercises every pipeline step (keyframe, video, voice, lipsync, music, sfx, ambient, post, assembly) at the lowest possible cost.

====

INT. DINER - NIGHT

Rain hammers the window. The last customer is gone. MAYA, 30s, wipes the counter in slow circles, not really seeing it.

The neon sign outside stutters, throwing red across her face.

MAYA
We're closed.

She looks up. The door is still shut. The bell above it has not moved.

MAYA (CONT'D)
I said we're closed.

The stutter of the sign settles. Steady red. Maya sets down the cloth.

FADE OUT.
